\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Discrete gauge link configurations defining the interpolation bounds for $P_1 = -1$. Empty brackets $\{\}$ denote a zero-length origin link, while numerical arrays (e.g., $\{1,3,1\}$) give the sequence of directional steps.\relax }}{65}{table.caption.15}%
